---
id: alternatives_generate
version: "1.0"
output_schema: AltGenerateOut
---
TASK: Write {{ n }} alternative versions of the {{ target_label }} of this script, each using a different strategy:
{% for s in strategies %}
- {{ s.id }}: {{ s.description }}
{% endfor %}

LINES TO REPLACE ({{ span_words }} words):
{{ span_text }}

{% if before_text %}
LINES JUST BEFORE (keep, the new version must follow from them):
{{ before_text }}
{% endif %}
{% if after_text %}
LINES JUST AFTER (keep, the new version must flow into them):
{{ after_text }}
{% endif %}

Hard constraints:
- Keep the established character names and facts. Do not add new main characters.
- Keep the language and register: {{ language }}.
- Length between {{ min_words }} and {{ max_words }} words in total.
- Write 2 to {{ max_elements }} screenplay elements: kind (action, dialogue, parenthetical, transition), speaker (only for dialogue, else null), text.
{% if is_ending %}
- The ending must pay off setups from earlier lines: list them in pays_off_line_ids.
{% else %}
- pays_off_line_ids: an empty list.
{% endif %}
- strategy: the strategy id. rationale: at most 25 words on why it is stronger.
